+# Training operators + queues (GitOps install)
+
+This folder is a placeholder for GitOps-managed installation of:
+- Kubeflow Training Operator (PyTorchJob)
+- Kueue (queueing + admission)
+- Volcano (alternative scheduler)
+- Ray Operator (RayJob)
+- Gatekeeper/Kyverno (policy admission)
+
+Rationale:
+- Installing operators from the Aegis API is generally not acceptable in enterprise environments.
+- Instead, Aegis provides detection + templates and expects platform ops to install operators via GitOps/Helm.
+
+API endpoints:
+- GET `/v1/training/operators/status`
+- GET `/v1/training/queues/templates/kueue`
