+# Kyverno policies (placeholder)
+
+Recommended policies for multi-tenant AI:
+- require resource requests/limits
+- deny hostPath volumes
+- deny privileged containers
+- restrict egress except to allowed endpoints (S3/Vault/IdP)
+- require namespace labels for tenants
+
+These should be installed and enforced at cluster level using GitOps.
