+# Advanced AWS landing-zone scaffold (EKS)
+
+This is a scaffold towards enterprise-ready:
+- private subnets + NAT
+- placeholders for:
+  - multi-AZ
+  - managed node groups (CPU + GPU)
+  - Karpenter/Cluster Autoscaler
+  - private EKS endpoint
+  - private RDS (multi-AZ)
+  - secrets integration (External Secrets / CSI)
+  - Vault HA + DR
+  - multi-region DR drills + upgrade playbooks
+
+Why it's a scaffold:
+Enterprise landing zones vary heavily by org constraints. This gives structure in-repo and
+keeps Aegis installability moving in the right direction without pretending to solve all infra.
